---
/*
 * Starlight override. The brand is dark only (docs/brand-tokens.md): pin the theme instead of reading
 * `prefers-color-scheme` / localStorage. `StarlightThemeProvider` stays defined because Starlight's
 * scripts call it.
 */
---

<script is:inline>
  document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark'
  window.StarlightThemeProvider = { updatePickers() {} }
</script>
